# Per-profile/arch V8 startup snapshots are committed
# as ordinary Git blobs — see /.gitattributes and snapshots/README.md — so release builds
# are hermetic and the arm64 snapshot (not CI-generatable) has a home. They are
# therefore intentionally NOT ignored here.
#
# Legacy single-file location (pre per-arch layout) stays ignored.
/SNAPSHOT.bin
